ration now uses the AndroidKeyStore provider and named constants for the provider and alias.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n<strong>Priority: <picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/priority-low-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Low</strong>\n\n**Estimated code review effort:** 2 (Simple) | ~8 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"92f2723a4d962d0c4f423450086a969b0b34b951\" -->\n**Change:** Bug fix\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n**Suggested reviewers:** `yogeshpaliyal`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> · up to <code>92f27</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `92f27`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"92f2723a4d962d0c4f423450086a969b0b34b951\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"92f2723a4d962d0c4f423450086a969b0b34b951\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nNo actionable merge-blocking risk is identified; the change is mergeable after normal checks.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4 · <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> 1</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> Failed checks: 1 warning</strong>\n\n|     Check name     |                                              Status                                              | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                               | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :---------------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ![Warning](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-warning.svg) | Docstring coverage is 0.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. Docstring coverage is scoped to functions touched by this diff. Analyzed 3 functions across 1 files. | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> Passed checks: 4 passed</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n|         Check name         |                                             Status                                             | Explanation                                                                                                         |\